div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-301803 wuxingzhe.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c0/Spine_static-301803_wuxingzhe.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"151\" height=\"466\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"151\" data-file-height=\"466\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3018\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%BE%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85\" title=\"雾行者\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%BE%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85\" title=\"雾行者\"><img alt=\"雾行者\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%BE%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85\" title=\"雾行者\">雾行者</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>构成理念</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：301803</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“准时下班。接下来的8小时留给我自己。”<br />雾行者推开了工人俱乐部的大门。与西伯利亚的冬天相比，这里显得格外暖和，空气中弥漫着蒸汽和旧书本的气味。<br />不远处的桌子上，有人正在下棋。“西西里防御”，看得久了，他也能准确地叫出这些下法的名字——当然，仅限于名字。<br />随着士兵砍下了王的脑袋，棋局变得胶着。他觉得无趣，从口袋中摸出一颗糖，扔到了嘴里。稍远一些的地方响起了调试手风琴的声音——《莫斯科郊外的晚上》，一首正流行的歌曲。<br />如果不再有工作，那将会多么幸福。<br />他这样想着，拍了拍身边那只黑白相间的小猫。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"301803\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b1/Belonging-301804.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">劳保手套<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Work Gloves</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />4.5<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一副制式劳保手套，由工厂统一配发。样貌朴素，加厚的化纤材料能够有效保护劳动者的双手。如同它的使用者们那样，普通、沉默，却值得你托付信赖。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/99/Belonging-301805.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">维修用扳手<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Maintenance Wrench</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.95<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一把被受访者随身携带的扳手，上面经年累月的划痕清晰可见。在平凡而长久的工作中，它是受访者最趁手的朋友，也是他最坚实的伙伴。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301806.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c7/Belonging-301806.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“照亮前路”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Guiding Light\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />8<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>头戴式灯具，劳动者的标准护具之一，可用于确认彼此位置，驱散寒冷。当然，它最重要的用途是照亮前路。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%811.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 在俱乐部见1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%811.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%811.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%811.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%811.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%811.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%811.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%812.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 在俱乐部见2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%812.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%812.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%812.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%812.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%812.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%B1%E4%B9%90%E9%83%A8%E8%A7%812.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">在俱乐部见 <small style=\"color: grey\">See You at the Workers' Club</small></span></span>"}}